/// Layers a short, rapid camera "hit" on top of the resolved follow transform to sell a
/// "the player just took a hit" moment. While the camera follows the red dot and the dot
/// enters one of the two flanking hit squares — see <see cref="CameraDemoScreen.BallHitZone"/> —
